The '''Nebula Gamepass''' was a [[gamepass]] that was introduced by [[Nikilis]] on August 18th, 2021<ref>https://twitter.com/NikilisRBX/status/1428121827327442945</ref>. It was originally purchasable for 1,699 Robux, and contained the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] knife [[Nebula]]. The item inside is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the gamepass has since gone offsale.

==Trivia==
*This gamepass was purchasable for over ten months before being replaced by the [[Plasma Bundle]] on July 1st, 2022.
*The link to the gamepass can be found [https://www.roblox.com/game-pass/21348436/GODLY-Nebula here].
*This is the 9th item pack to contain a single item, the first eight being the [[Batwing Gamepass]], [[Icewing Gamepass]], [[Bioblade Gamepass]], [[Prismatic Gamepass]], [[Peppermint Gamepass]], [[Cookieblade Gamepass]],[[Heartblade Gamepass]] and the [[Eggblade Gamepass]].

